&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66fd2cc091c15d5150fd08f35ffbbf9a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！リクエストをご検討いただきありがとうございます！！！可能であれば、私のVTuberのイラストを描いていただけませんか？彼は月ウサギの男の子で、もちでできていて（ここには写っていませんが）ふわふわのしっぽがついています！！ポーズはご自由に決めてください！！必要に応じてデザインを簡略化しても構いません！！ただ、頬にそばかすがあることだけはぜひ描いてほしいです！！！本当にありがとうございます！！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tuUkcqu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roieoekaki/works/1300", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8cc31515/uploads/origins/677f38c8-3e1d-4135-8df7-5b0466929eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=350ded3532f87a4116a43fdd7146a39f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8cc31515/uploads/origins/677f38c8-3e1d-4135-8df7-5b0466929eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=350ded3532f87a4116a43fdd7146a39f, https://si.imgix.net/8cc31515/uploads/origins/677f38c8-3e1d-4135-8df7-5b0466929eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f026ebeebb5166eb66b8fde8c4c2031 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8cc31515/uploads/origins/677f38c8-3e1d-4135-8df7-5b0466929eef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04083b475021f7e99f382222eb881917 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "オワリ@さぶ様私のオリジナルキャラクター、ルーベンをあなたのスタイルで描いていただけませんか！複数のデザインがあるので、お好きなものを選んで描いてください：[オリジナル] https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dumip87Sgwix46dX1pW1_WYIUtEiEN0Z?usp=sharing\n[ドラゴン] https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VZqTA4g_cLdJLE-JNqcvKwFISEcERak8?usp=sharing ご検討いただき本当にありがとうございます！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roieoekaki/works/1299", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b394046/uploads/origins/16233df0-bda6-4baa-8a92-f48075b798dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79b33a5cae394d8e1dd5e247fb0479e9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b394046/uploads/origins/16233df0-bda6-4baa-8a92-f48075b798dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79b33a5cae394d8e1dd5e247fb0479e9, https://si.imgix.net/8b394046/uploads/origins/16233df0-bda6-4baa-8a92-f48075b798dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b1e4730f600ef8af49ddc9e1fa9e435 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b394046/uploads/origins/16233df0-bda6-4baa-8a92-f48075b798dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55493b8355e28404e1bd8b4a1189de14 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your artwork! I would like you to draw my vtuber in her sleepy outfit! She is a fox girl. She has a mascot named \"Peep\" who is a baby chick. Feel free to include him!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1W4SLOBo1zpp4otxg62cGd_bONdUACNca?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roieoekaki/works/1298", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58cab174/uploads/origins/bd4f6121-acf3-4195-9ce3-4458b1e41c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b17cf59aca7a282c74898f5ba4348772", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58cab174/uploads/origins/bd4f6121-acf3-4195-9ce3-4458b1e41c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b17cf59aca7a282c74898f5ba4348772, https://si.imgix.net/58cab174/uploads/origins/bd4f6121-acf3-4195-9ce3-4458b1e41c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=daf2ed480bfca4b656f6d1741341afc0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58cab174/uploads/origins/bd4f6121-acf3-4195-9ce3-4458b1e41c49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c10154ef026df94fb3d6b79fdd79f94 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hii! your art is really cute!\nPlease draw my vtuber character Krumroll!\n\nShe is a fisher catgirl but she is really bad at fishing!\nShe's silly, very clumsy and gets easily flustered!\nShe wears a tuna can hat but she hates eating fish!\n\nPlease draw her in any way you like as long as its cute!!\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2xRD1Cd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roieoekaki/works/1297", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84a592ac/uploads/origins/7cc7f6d8-3c2c-42bf-af16-c71e0915e3e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4724c8b3808443c9eea674823861aab", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84a592ac/uploads/origins/7cc7f6d8-3c2c-42bf-af16-c71e0915e3e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4724c8b3808443c9eea674823861aab, https://si.imgix.net/84a592ac/uploads/origins/7cc7f6d8-3c2c-42bf-af16-c71e0915e3e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e2cb74c24f648499521c6322c24dc09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84a592ac/uploads/origins/7cc7f6d8-3c2c-42bf-af16-c71e0915e3e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c87631e3aadb9f2e5bbd21dd317bb03 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "服と相棒1枚目固定、髪色、ヘアピン2枚目固定、その他おまかせでご依頼させて頂きたいです。\n\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\n1枚目⬇️\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/15OYCir4KXfhUUz8SRN9Ni5DfQjZg-pEy/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n2枚目⬇️\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ot11VNmBQZ3JUC7Eu_d8KVt6C_HhMrep/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roieoekaki/works/1296", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/465e9efc/uploads/origins/873f758c-ee8b-4277-acc3-d46364faddf7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb63bf3404885e8dc36e66cd32db9cca", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/465e9efc/uploads/origins/873f758c-ee8b-4277-acc3-d46364faddf7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb63bf3404885e8dc36e66cd32db9cca, https://si.imgix.net/465e9efc/uploads/origins/873f758c-ee8b-4277-acc3-d46364faddf7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0d7ad951cd5d9a04ab04e20490f8638 2x, https://si.imgix.net/465e9efc/up